    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"cdb10aba-2403-436a-88c7-c6ff423bc7c7\" ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>In some places, 3G USB modems might be only way to connect our servers to internet. Below is a guideline to install and use 3G dongles in linux.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p><div><div>Install wvdial to be used for dialing 3G modem</div><div><p>&nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"74e1276c-3be7-4216-9b10-96ef18a9c50f\" ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[yum install wvdial]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div>Now create a configuration file for wvdial in &lsquo;<span>/etc/wvdial.conf</span>'</div><div><p>&nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"1d566946-9148-4a07-a12a-f53d5b8eadba\" ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[    vi /etc/wvdial.conf]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></div><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"be6e4d3b-95fe-4a88-a1b6-1296aa7d2602\" ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Dialer Defaults</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[[Dialer Defaults]\nInit1 = ATZ\nInit2 = ATQ0 V1 E1 S0=0 &C1 &D2\nInit3 = AT+CGDCONT=1,\"IP”,\"<APN of Internet provider>\"\nStupid Mode = 1\nModem Type = USB Modem\nNew PPPD = no\nModem = /dev/ttyUSB2\nISDN = 0\nAuto Reconnect = 1\nPhone = *99#\nUsername = <Provider username>\nPassword = <Provider password>\nBaud = 460800\nCarrier Check = no\n]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><div>Install required libraries and tools.</div><div><p>&nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"d7449fb4-c318-4cb4-b711-3a7b2626f537\" ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[yum install tcl usbutils libusb1-devel]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div>Download <strong>usb_modeswitch</strong> and <strong>usb_modeswitch_data</strong></div><div><p>&nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"18716edb-85ef-4fc0-96a2-98ee2f96347d\" ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Download using wget command</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[wget http://www.draisberghof.de/usb_modeswitch/usb-modeswitch-data-20151101.tar.bz2 #or latest\nwget http://www.draisberghof.de/usb_modeswitch/usb-modeswitch-2.2.6.tar.bz2  #or latest]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div>Extract and install</div><div><code><code><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></code></code><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"4d78b74c-1aff-4026-9e36-a4e50a0804a4\" ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[tar xvfj usb-modewitch-2.2.6.tar.bz2\ntar xvfj usb-modewitch-data-20151101.tar.bz2\n\ncd usb-modewitch-2.2.6\nmake install\n\ncd usb-modewitch-data-20151101\nmake install]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div><code><span><br /></span></code></div><div><code><strong>usb_modeswitch</strong> creates some udev rules to automatically change the mode of 3G dongle to act as usb_modem</code></div><div>Now plug in your 3G dongle, it should automatically be detected.</div><div><p>&nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"06ea0b18-2198-4c47-ac68-06e0f11f2e97\" ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[     dmesg | grep tty   # should show something like 'GSM modem (1-port) converter now attached to ttyUSB0'\n     sudo wvdial &\n\n]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">Now this should start dialing via 3G modem, and internet should be started.</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><br /></span></div><div><p>&nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"3874bac1-deac-44eb-a66b-b1bbf80b1ea4\" ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>For more info -&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(102,102,102);\"><a href=\"http://www.draisberghof.de/usb_modeswitch/\">http://www.draisberghof.de/usb_modeswitch/</a></span></strong></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div><span><br /></span></div>",
